## Hard rules

- **Tenant:** {{tenant}}. **Account:** {{account}}. Use this account in every browser, picker and tool; never another signed-in account.
- **Environment:** {{environment name}} ({{environment URL}}, id {{environment id}}). Run `pac org who` and confirm before any change to Dataverse, flows or the app.
- **Solution:** {{SolutionName}} (publisher {{Publisher}}, prefix `{{prefix}}`). Create components only inside it.
- Ask before: publishing, turning flows on, sending messages, changing permissions or sharing, deleting data, granting consent prompts.
- Never put secrets, tokens or personal data in files, commands or logs.

## Layout of the repo

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `app/` | Canvas app source (.pa.yaml), synced from Studio |
| `scripts/` | Schema as code, idempotent deploy, seed, solution export |
| `flow/` | Flow builders and generated JSON |
| `solution/` | Exported solution snapshot |
| `docs/` | Architecture and runbooks |

